Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不过我在想可否先…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but I was wondering, do you think it would be possible...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}预先给我一百元的薪水？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...if I got a $100 advance on my salary?{\r}
