Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们每年都会去维尔滑雪场 我爸都会帮我买机票{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}See, every year, we go skiing in Vail, and normally my father pays for my ticket...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}由于我已经开始 要求独立…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but I've sort of started this whole independent thing, you know...{\r}
