Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋，瑞秋，亲爱的！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Rachel, Rachel, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你是个很糟，很糟，很糟的服务生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're a terrible, terrible waitress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真的，真的很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Really, really awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道你的意思了 我赞成你的观点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, I hear what you're saying. I'm with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}呃…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}可是我很努力 而且我觉得自己已经进步了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But I'm trying really hard, and I think I'm doing better.{\r}
