Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉，先生 嗨，你常常来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Excuse me, sir? Hi. You come in here all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:01:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在想你是否可以{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}MAN: Uh-huh. - I was just wondering...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有可能先预借给我一点小费{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...you think there's a possibility you could give me an advance on my tips?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Huh? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好，好，没关系的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}RACHEL: Okay, okay. That's fine, fine.{\r}
