Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉曾经给你打翻过！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Sorry about that spill before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只剩九十八块五毛钱了！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Only 98.50 to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hey. Hey. ROSS & CHANDLER: Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：杰夫·葛林斯坦  杰夫·史特劳斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯 你知道爸跟妈 要去波多黎各过感恩节吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ross, did you know that Mom and Dad are going to Puerto Rico for Thanksgiving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么？不，不会的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What? No, they're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 有，布莱曼家邀请他们去的 - 你搞错了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Yes, they are. The Blymans invited them. - You're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 我没错 - 你搞错了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- I am not wrong. - You're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，我才跟他们谈过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, I just talked to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要打给妈{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm calling Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：詹姆斯·柏洛斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嘿，嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hey, hey. MONICA & CHANDLER: Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嘿 - 咖啡{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hey. - Coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是求救专线的发问 你脸上有化妆吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And this from the Cry for Help Department: Are you wearing makeup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对，有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}今天我已是正式的 乔伊·崔比亚尼，演员兼模特儿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}As of today, I am officially Joey Tribbiani, actor/model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:03:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太好玩了，我觉得你比较像 乔伊·崔比亚尼，男人兼女人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's funny, I was thinking you look more like Joey Tribbiani, man/woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你在当哪种模特儿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What were you modeling for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}义诊的海报当平面模特儿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know those posters for the City Free Clinic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以你要去扮演 健康男人的角色{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, wow. You're gonna be one of those healthy, healthy, healthy guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}宣传气喘那个人真的很可爱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Ah? - The asthma guy's really cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 对啊 - 可不是吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Oh, he is. RACHEL: Isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 知道你要当哪种宣传大使吗  - 不知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- You know which one you're gonna be? - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不过我听说莱姆病有缺人 所以呢…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But I hear Lyme disease is open, so, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}祝你好运 希望你能得到{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Good luck, man. I hope you get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你说对了 他们怎么可以这样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, you were right. How can they do this to us, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是感恩节耶！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's Thanksgiving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这样子好了 我在我那边做晚餐好吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Aw. Tell you what. How about if I cook dinner at my place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会弄得很像妈妈煮的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'll make it just like Mom's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你会做有颗粒的洋芋泥吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Will you make the mashed potatoes with the lumps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}本来就不该有…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know they're not actually supposed to...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我会设法弄些颗粒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'll work on the lumps.{\r}
