Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是你的感恩节晚餐？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait, this is what you're having for Thanksgiving dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你跟这个节日有什么仇？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What is it with you and this holiday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当时我九岁{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, I'm 9 years old.{\r}
