Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们才吃完丰富的感恩节大餐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We've just finished Thanksgiving dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我嘴里…我记得的很清楚 还塞满南瓜派{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I have... And I remember this part vividly. - A mouthful of pumpkin pie.{\r}
