Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对，在梅西百货的时候 你就是迷惑香水女孩，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, at Macy's. You're the Obsession girl, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 对 - 我就是〝雅男仕〞香水那个{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Yes. - I was the Aramis guy.{\r}
