Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谁要白起司 谁要黑起司的？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, who wants light cheese and who wants dark cheese?{\r}
